{"version":1,"content":"<p>外電報道，台灣財長莊翠雲下周將赴港參加亞太經合組織（APEC）財長會議。</p><p>台灣的財政部回覆查詢時確認，莊翠雲將按APEC程序赴港參加財長會議，並說與先前勞動部長洪申翰到南京參加APEC人力資源發展部長會議的原則一樣。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:07.473002+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T08:44:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723560+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723560+00:00","content_hash":"c3a94f8dcd0ddd0868c1ac17a1cf8715941bfc1be7249a6513302ae942dd35c7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}